  simpa only [bernListCheck,Bool.and_eq_true,decide_eq_true_eq,and_assoc] using (show (a<mid ∧ mid<b) ∧ bernListCheck p a mid L=true ∧ bernListCheck p mid b R=true from ⟨hm,hL,hR⟩)
